# Module Complete Gate — ElintOM18.00 PHP Upgrade

**Never mark a module ✅ complete** from list/index screens alone.

**Upgrade method:** Module fixes = **syntax-only** on ElintOM18.00 files (no delete, no rename, no whole-file copy). See `php-upgrade-core.mdc` § ElintOM18.00 — Syntax Only. **इतर project/path चा reference नाही.**

## Scope — Which Modules to Test

