## Required Per Module (in order)

1. **Screen** — `phase4_{module}_test.php` (list, add, main AJAX).
2. **Deep submit** — `phase4_{module}_deep_test.php` (save flow).
3. **Deep links** — `phase4_{module}_links_test.php` (**mandatory**, module-wise):
   - Every P1 URL with `{id}`, `?query`, or view→controller link from `themes/default/views/{module}/`
   - Examples: `print_barcodes/{id}`, `view/{id}`, `edit/{id}`, `pdf/{id}`, `modal_view/{id}`
   - Use **real IDs** from DataTables/AJAX (not only `id=1`)
   - Assert HTTP 200 (or expected redirect), no fatal/TypeError
4. **Stock/special** (if module has inventory): `phase4_{module}_stock_deep_test.php` when applicable.
5. **Grep** — PHP 8.5 patterns below on that module's controller + views.
6. **Plan** — update `upgrade/PHP_UPGRADE_PLAN.md` fix table + testing log.
7. **Fixes log** — append **Old → New** rows to `upgrade/PHP_UPGRADE_FIXES_LOG.md` per `php-upgrade-fixes-log.mdc`.
8. **Commit** — module ✅ complete झाल्यावर **त्याच session मध्ये** scoped git commit — see `php-module-commit-gate.mdc` (one module = one commit).

## When User Says "test" / "deep check"

- Run **all existing** `phase4_*` scripts for modules with fixes + test scripts (1–11 — all **not done** until retest passes).
- If deep-link script missing for an upgraded module, **create it first**, then run.
- Report per module: screen / deep / deep-links pass counts.

## PHP 8.5 — Grep Each Upgraded Module

| Pattern | Risk | Minimal fix |
|---------|------|-------------|
| `array_values($this->...->get...()` | `false` → TypeError | `is_array($x) ? array_values($x) : []` |
| `foreach ($rows` without guard | null → TypeError | `if (!empty($rows)) { foreach ...` |
| `redirect($_SERVER["HTTP_REFERER"])` | missing header | `isset(...) ? ... : site_url('fallback')` |
| `$obj->prop` after `getByID()` | false → fatal | early redirect |
| `count($_POST['key'])` | missing key | `isset(...) ? sizeof(...) : 0` |
| `strip_tags(post('x'))` when `x` + `x[]` posted | array → TypeError | `is_array($v) ? '' : (string)$v` |

## Plan Wording

- **✅ Screen PASS** — list/add/AJAX only.
- **✅ Deep PASS** — submit flow OK.
- **✅ Deep-links PASS** — `phase4_{module}_links_test.php` all green.
- **✅ Module complete** — only when screen + deep + deep-links pass for that module.

## Example — Products deep links (must not skip)

```
GET /products/print_barcodes/{id}
GET /products/view/{id}
GET /products/edit/{id}
GET /products/modal_view/{id}
GET /products/quantity_adjustments
GET /products/add_adjustment
```

Missed deep link = not complete (e.g. `print_barcodes/238` was 500 until `array_values(false)` fix).
